====== ALLNET ALL0305 ======

The ALL0305 is a dual-band access-point/bridge system with aluminium outdoor IP68 enclosure.
Support for the board used in the device was added to OpenWrt trunk and the device comes with a patched version backfire 10.03 pre-installed.

